abstract: "Python literature-review toolkit: unified search across arXiv, PubMed, Semantic Scholar, CrossRef, OpenAlex and DBLP, parallel PDF download with retry tracking and indexing, local Ollama LLM summarization, BibTeX export, and meta-analysis plots including PCA, keyword clustering and publication trends."
